        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "02b8b4b6-386c-3f00-beec-88e28e75a812",
                "word": "hypercherie",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "cde2cfe8-2a79-4de0-ba0e-9ef5aa6511b4",
                        "entry_id": "02b8b4b6-386c-3f00-beec-88e28e75a812",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "hypercheries"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "392c7ca5-dd27-3799-94d6-03f42f43b7bc",
                        "entry_id": "02b8b4b6-386c-3f00-beec-88e28e75a812",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Tromperie particulièrement grande."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Extrêmement rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e03415e-a6df-4835-b511-85f84bc220d1",
                                "sense_id": "392c7ca5-dd27-3799-94d6-03f42f43b7bc",
                                "text": "- Vous êtes au courant de l’arnaque ? C'est l’hypercherie ! L’embrouille totale. Tout est truqué. Silbermann, ça vous dit quelque chose ? C'est lui le cerveau de la magouille !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc632fc6-8308-4bd9-9183-31750a70a858",
                                "sense_id": "392c7ca5-dd27-3799-94d6-03f42f43b7bc",
                                "text": "Et si tout cela n’était qu’une immense machine de guerre, une hypercherie nationale à la solde d’une poignée d’ultra capitalistes prêts à tout pour satisfaire leurs besoins insatiables de profits ?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f658e38-794d-41dd-960d-11f42ddb17db",
                                "sense_id": "392c7ca5-dd27-3799-94d6-03f42f43b7bc",
                                "text": "Ce n’est plus de la supercherie, c’est de l’hypercherie. C’est le seul mot qui me vient à l’esprit à l’écoute quotidienne des nouvelles du monde tant toutes les affaires des hommes me semblent falsifiées."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "56cdfdb6-4a4f-3297-ae60-cffe39967d40",
                        "entry_id": "02b8b4b6-386c-3f00-beec-88e28e75a812",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Hypertrucage, trucage de haute technicité, deepfake."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Extrêmement rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "603bd17c-0dc4-4f66-b520-f364a3cbdb75",
                                "sense_id": "56cdfdb6-4a4f-3297-ae60-cffe39967d40",
                                "text": "Lors des neuf premiers mois de l’année 2019, le nombre de ces « hypercheries » (traduction libre en français) a en effet explosé dans les univers numériques à travers le monde, passant d’environ 8000 fin 2018 à 14 700 cet automne, selon une mesure réalisée par la compagnie spécialisée en cybersécurité Deeptrace."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "57a4522d-588b-405b-85d0-1d909728b181",
                                "sense_id": "56cdfdb6-4a4f-3297-ae60-cffe39967d40",
                                "text": "Tout comme les fake news, les capsules deepfakes ne présentent pas uniquement des informations erronées, elles sont volontairement trompeuses. Malgré des débuts timides en politiques, ces hypercheries présentent aujourd’hui un potentiel énorme."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "80c35bba-e26f-47b7-ae5b-58b9a2d58b01",
                                "sense_id": "56cdfdb6-4a4f-3297-ae60-cffe39967d40",
                                "text": "Comme beaucoup de termes dans le domaine de l’intelligence artificielle, celui de deepfake relève d’un concept plus culturel que scientifique, qui regroupe des technologies variées, au croisement du deep learning et de fake events. En québécois, on parle d’hypercherie : une supercherie, la puissance au-dessus."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a95b9c8c-8338-4b7a-b893-0c268bf00671",
                        "source_entry_id": "02b8b4b6-386c-3f00-beec-88e28e75a812",
                        "source_sense_description": "Trucage de haute technicité",
                        "target_lang_word": "deepfake",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "deepfake",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fc5a57d8-cfeb-318b-a5a8-7351916929b1",
                                        "entry_id": "003d9935-9f98-3463-b199-48beef62850e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A convincingly realistic but fake image, video, or audio created with the use of artificial intelligence, especially one that imposes the face of one person onto the body of someone else."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c3f391a-33cd-43d1-8625-f532efe955de",
                                                "sense_id": "fc5a57d8-cfeb-318b-a5a8-7351916929b1",
                                                "text": "Did you see that leaked sex tape with the actress? It turned out to be a deepfake, but it looked so realistic!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d5fea3d-13e0-4cf1-b83f-70bc2473d45f",
                                                "sense_id": "fc5a57d8-cfeb-318b-a5a8-7351916929b1",
                                                "text": "The thing is that normal people might try to use to harass other people, specially women, but I don't think this technology will be so advanced that you won't be able to recognize it's a fake video, so the majority of people who try to say a deep fake is real will be looked as an idiot, a pervert and probably reported."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32453e14-12cc-45ef-bf77-0bac45b551b0",
                                                "sense_id": "fc5a57d8-cfeb-318b-a5a8-7351916929b1",
                                                "text": "These deepfakes went in a completely unexpected direction"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cfbb1feb-87a0-400d-b98d-bd68b87cd7a9",
                                                "sense_id": "fc5a57d8-cfeb-318b-a5a8-7351916929b1",
                                                "text": "I've completed a desktop app /w GUI to create deepfakes. Here is a what it looks like. For anyone unfamiliar with this subreddit, deepfakes are neural network-generated faceswap videos created with a machine learning algorithm designed by /u/deepfakes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c3202e2-8503-4e87-aa1b-702b1103a552",
                                                "sense_id": "fc5a57d8-cfeb-318b-a5a8-7351916929b1",
                                                "text": "For example, images of the actress Scarlett Johansson have been used to create a number of deepfake pornographic videos, one of which had been viewed over 1.5 million times on a popular SEIM site by the end of 2018 (Harwell, 2018)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87a4b779-18c7-4349-9e9b-da7feb292e55",
                                                "sense_id": "fc5a57d8-cfeb-318b-a5a8-7351916929b1",
                                                "text": "By banning deepfakes before the technology becomes widespread, Facebook is trying to calm lawmakers, academics and political campaigns who remain frustrated by how the company handles political posts and videos about politics and politicians."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "deepfake",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "978a9a3b-2485-3f14-98b2-bc14ba197d2b",
                                        "entry_id": "d00806c4-aad2-3400-bd5c-94b61b8fb616",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To create or turn into a deepfake; to impersonate someone with a deepfake."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93e9a233-cf64-4622-8f95-2dcc1d29ae02",
                                                "sense_id": "978a9a3b-2485-3f14-98b2-bc14ba197d2b",
                                                "text": "He deepfaked himself, no one suffered demonstrable harm from it and he admitted it when confronted."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "930f6a37-1fe5-41fa-9cde-4cfed63b2d02",
                                                "sense_id": "978a9a3b-2485-3f14-98b2-bc14ba197d2b",
                                                "text": "Currently, few laws around the world pertain to deepfaked porn."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
